Drop sample subdirs incompatible with hermetic bst sandbox.

image_generation, video_generation, and visual_language_chat (both cpp and c)
use file(DOWNLOAD ...) for stb_image.h / stb_image_write.h which bypasses
FetchContent and can't be redirected via FETCHCONTENT_SOURCE_DIR_<NAME>.
image_generation additionally pulls OpenCV via ExternalProject_Add git clone.

speech_generation, automatic_speech_recognition, omni, and whisper_speech
need dr_libs; dropping them simplifies the prestage list.

The AI PC demo only needs text generation (chat_sample, benchmark_genai).
Keep cpp/text_generation, cpp/rag (no deps), c/text_generation (no deps).

